spans.s:
(1) = विभीतक (Avk; Bpn, p. 9; Dgv, nr. 149; Dn 1, 212; Gul; HB;
HK; KB 2, p. 1017-1020; MW; Pr 220; PW; Rn 11, 322-323; V 6, p.
160; Vśs);
(2) a) = रुद्राक्ष (Avk; Vśs);
b) the seed of रुद्राक्ष (MW; PW);
(3) a) = इन्द्राक्ष (Vśs: = the tuberous root of the creeper called
ऋषभक);
b) = ऋषभक (Avk; Vśs); ऋषभक is an unidentifiable plant,
but Vśs identifies it as CARPOPOGON PRURIENS; see: कपि-
कच्छू̆;
(4) = देवशिरीष (Vśs, unidentified).
